msgid ""
"This is the Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ) for FreeBSD.  Every effort has "
"been made to make this FAQ as informative as possible."
msgstr ""
"这是 FreeBSD {rel-relx} 和 {rel2-relx} 的常见问题集（FAQ）。我们尽可能在此常"
