#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/faq/_index.adoc:363
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "How can I get help in a FreeBSD system?"
msgstr "如何在 FreeBSD 系统中获得帮助？"

#. type: .abstract-title
#: documentation/content/en/books/faq/_index.adoc:368
#, fuzzy
