msgid "Are there FreeBSD IRC (Internet Relay Chat) channels?"
msgstr "有 FreeBSD IRC（互联网中继聊天）频道吗？"

#. type: .abstract-title
#: documentation/content/en/books/faq/_index.adoc:385
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Yes, most major IRC networks host a FreeBSD chat channel and the FreeBSD "
"wiki holds an up to date link:https://wiki.freebsd.org/IRC/Channels[list of "
"IRC channels]."
msgstr "有，大多数主要 IRC 网络都设有 FreeBSD 聊天频道，FreeBSD Wiki 上也维护着一份最新的 link:https://wiki.freebsd.org/IRC/Channels[IRC 频道列表]。"

#. type: .abstract-title
#: documentation/content/en/books/faq/_index.adoc:388
