msgstr "这些频道彼此独立，互不相连。由于各频道的聊天风格不同，不妨逐一尝试，找到适合自己的频道。"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/faq/_index.adoc:390
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Are there any web based forums to discuss FreeBSD?"
