"org/[FreeBSD Forums homepage]."
msgstr "FreeBSD 官方论坛位于 link:https://forums.FreeBSD.org/[FreeBSD 论坛主页]。"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/faq/_index.adoc:395
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Where do I find info on the FreeBSD mailing lists?"
msgstr "在哪里可以找到 FreeBSD 邮件列表的信息？"

#. type: .abstract-title
#: documentation/content/en/books/faq/_index.adoc:398
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The public mailing lists can be found at the link:https://lists.freebsd.org/"
"[FreeBSD mailing lists]."
